    "name": "Pea Shoot Microgreens",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pea shoot microgreens are the&nbsp;young, tender leaves, stems, and tendrils of the pea plant, offering a sweet, crisp, and slightly nutty flavor reminiscent of fresh snap peas. Typically harvested within 10–14 days, they are nutrient-dense, rich in vitamins A, C, and K, folic acid, and essential amino acids.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Gorge Greens (WA)</span></p>",
